@startuml
!include style.iuml
hide empty description
state "In Review" as InReview
[*] --> Draft : food added to catalogue file
Draft --> InReview : submitted
InReview --> Draft : validation failed or\nchanges requested
InReview --> Verified : approved by a second\nteam member / load into database
Verified : visible in search and recognition
Verified --> InReview : correction submitted\n(current values stay visible)
Verified --> Deprecated : removed / link replacing food
Deprecated : hidden from search;\npast entries remain valid
Draft : not visible to users
@enduml
